{"4012690":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"The Big Hollow: 1982","steam_appid":4012690,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4012690\/extras\/756dace7c2393832271db48b4a238489.poster.avif?t=1783398005\" width=780 height=456 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4012690\/extras\/756dace7c2393832271db48b4a238489.mp4?t=1783398005\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this short murder mystery set in a small truck stop community you will need to think like a killer to find one and prove your worth as a detective. Learn the art of criminal profiling by scanning pictures for clues, trying to find psychological patterns and linking different cases. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t just about murder; it's about figuring out if monsters can be mapped.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4012690\/extras\/f28c639d2198d41503eafdef3fe2f70d.poster.avif?t=1783398005\" width=648 height=362 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4012690\/extras\/f28c639d2198d41503eafdef3fe2f70d.mp4?t=1783398005\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Think Like a Killer <\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine evidence using techniques inspired by FBI thought processes and procedure<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan pictures for clues<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make links between findings  <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Present your hypothesis<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4012690\/extras\/d8f91f7a875160198a1aa0b5f42ba6ca.poster.avif?t=1783398005\" width=650 height=364 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4012690\/extras\/d8f91f7a875160198a1aa0b5f42ba6ca.mp4?t=1783398005\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1982 in the American South<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tightly focused 2.5 to 3 hour case that tells a deep, atmospheric story in the 1980s American South.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Desmond, methodical and intuitive, learning the art of criminal profiling under Lenore Davidson, the cold, exacting representative of the BSU.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A case full of fragments, contradictions, and unfolding secrets. Decipher the 'why' behind the crime, shaping Lenore’s impression of your potential as a profiler.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4012690\/extras\/abea0f7d6e56a2c7ec5880c98382980f.avif?t=1783398005\" width=1200 height=320 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Map the Monster<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For fans of true crime, puzzles, and modernized 2D point-and-click adventures alike.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The Big Hollow: 1982<\/i><\/strong> is about deduction through a grounded, cinematic lens: <strong><i>The Case of the Golden Idol<\/i><\/strong> meets <strong><i>The Silence of the Lambs<\/i><\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the FBI, the term 'serial killer' is as new as their Behavioral Science Unit. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your insights prove the BSU’s worth, or expose its limitations?  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4012690\/extras\/756dace7c2393832271db48b4a238489.poster.avif?t=1783398005\" width=780 height=456 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4012690\/extras\/756dace7c2393832271db48b4a238489.mp4?t=1783398005\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this short murder mystery set in a small truck stop community you will need to think like a killer to find one and prove your worth as a detective. Learn the art of criminal profiling by scanning pictures for clues, trying to find psychological patterns and linking different cases. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t just about murder; it's about figuring out if monsters can be mapped.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4012690\/extras\/f28c639d2198d41503eafdef3fe2f70d.poster.avif?t=1783398005\" width=648 height=362 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4012690\/extras\/f28c639d2198d41503eafdef3fe2f70d.mp4?t=1783398005\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Think Like a Killer <\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine evidence using techniques inspired by FBI thought processes and procedure<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan pictures for clues<\/p><\/li><li><p clas